WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.129 --> 00:00:08.210
Working for the Waimakariri District Council
is rewarding, with competitive salaries,

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:12.020
highly active social groups and strong career advancement opportunities.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:18.120
We're focused on serving our community, and
when you build a team of over 300 dedicated,

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:23.260
qualified and friendly people - you can be
sure goods things are going to happen.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.439
The staff have a great relationship with councillors
and community board members and we're all here

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:32.420
for the same purpose, and that is to make
Waimakariri a great place to be

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.340
in partnership with our communities.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:42.800
Waimakariri District is just 15 minutes north
of Christchurch.

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:48.190
Our district combines the best of town and
country, with the urban centres of Rangiora,

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:53.180
Kaiapoi, Oxford and Pegasus, large productive
rural areas, costal settlements

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:55.100
and small rural townships.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:03.850
It is also one of the fastest growing districts
in the country and that variety and challenge

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:06.700
makes the WDC an exciting place to be.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.460
A lot of the work we do is unseen.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:13.100
Sewerage, water, community support

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:17.420
building the foundations a 
growing community thrives on.

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:20.940
We design the parks, build the roads, 
maintain the pools

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:23.700
and we plan for the future of our district.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.219
And we’re good at it.

00:01:28.219 --> 00:01:32.639
Our award- winning teams are respected in
their fields and have a wealth of experience

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:34.740
to share with those starting their careers.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:41.520
Council has been really supportive to me,
in training, experience and mentoring to become

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.240
a chartered professional engineer.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:50.120
Frequent social events, friendly co-workers
and advancement opportunities all make our

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:53.450
council an excellent place to set up a long
term career.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:58.880
I've had all sorts of opportunities, from
professional development right through to

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:03.320
new job opportunities, that have been able
to grow and enhance my skills and let me do

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:04.740
new things around the community.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:11.520
However for a lot of us, perhaps the greatest
satisfaction comes from helping to build a

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.940
district that people are proud to call home.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:18.720
I love that I get to come to work every day
and work with fun and energetic people who

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.980
really like to make a difference in our community.

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:28.040
So if you want to work with us in making Waimakariri
a great place to live

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:33.320
visit our recruitment page 
waimakariri.govt.nz/careers

